Subject: [PATCH 10/10] jay: rebase onto Mesa main 4c12390be30: scoreboard and
 BTD SIMD width as merged

The commits of this part were written on an older Mesa; replayed on
4c12390be30 these two places came out different from the merge that was
tested: jay_lower_scoreboard.c as resolved there, and main's BTD width
clamp in jay_emit_btd_ops.
